  description: "Apply 1 of these effects.\r\n\u25CF Special Summon 1 \"Vaalmonica\"
    monster from your Deck, also for the rest of this turn after this card resolves,
    you cannot activate the effects of monsters on the field, except \"Vaalmonica\"
    monsters.\r\n\u25CF If you control a non-Pendulum \"Vaalmonica\" monster, take
    2 \"Vaalmonica\" Pendulum Monsters with different names from your Deck, add 1
    of them to your hand, and add the other to your face-up Extra Deck.\r\nYou can
    only activate 1 \"Vaalmonica Invitare\" per turn."
